{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reviews</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201d\u2026even in its current state, it\u2019s already one of the more captivating multiplayer shooters on Steam right now.\u201d <strong>IGN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cBattleBit has echoes of what Eric Barone did with Stardew Valley: a small game that punches above its weight and wins people over with unexpected depth and quality.\u201d <strong>PC Gamer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIf you\u2019ve grown tired of extraction shooters and battle royale games and crave something more focused on gunplay, combat, and just having fun over grinding and seasons, I\u2019d recommend\u00a0<i>BattleBit Remastered</i>.\u201d <strong>Kotaku</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into chaotic, large-scale FPS battles with up to 254 players in <i>BattleBit Remastered</i>! Whether you're storming enemy positions with Assault or building critical defences as support, every role counts in this low-poly, adrenaline-pumping battleground. Squad up with open VOIP and level cities with fully destructible environments. Ready to experience the ultimate team-based warfare?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Primary features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible Environments\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/8cff82274c102c808f6befc81329c82d.poster.avif?t=1730393449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/8cff82274c102c808f6befc81329c82d.webm?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/8cff82274c102c808f6befc81329c82d.mp4?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear down walls, collapse buildings, and reshape the battlefield with dynamic 'levolution' mechanics, where every action leaves a lasting impact on the world around you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customizable weapons (WIP)\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/ae6dfbe685917e39f5d2d4468f494a74.poster.avif?t=1730393449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/ae6dfbe685917e39f5d2d4468f494a74.webm?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/ae6dfbe685917e39f5d2d4468f494a74.mp4?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Tailor your arsenal to your playstyle in <i>BattleBit Remastered</i>! Modify everything from scopes to grips or barrels to mags. Create the perfect weapon loadout to dominate every battleground.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >254 Player servers\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/611117d20181595cbd811c9fa4f71487.poster.avif?t=1730393449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/611117d20181595cbd811c9fa4f71487.webm?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/611117d20181595cbd811c9fa4f71487.mp4?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Join the chaos with up to 254 players in epic, large-scale battles! <i>BattleBit Remastered</i> offers massive multiplayer servers where proximity-based voice chat brings every encounter to life! Coordinate strategies or taunt the enemy as you fight for control in the ever-evolving battleground!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicular combat with tanks, helicopters, transports, and sea vehicles.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/2a3d88b00e1fda35b473ad6016327d4d.poster.avif?t=1730393449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/2a3d88b00e1fda35b473ad6016327d4d.webm?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/2a3d88b00e1fda35b473ad6016327d4d.mp4?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Dominate the battlefield with an arsenal of vehicles at your command! From tanks and helicopters to transports and sea vessels, <i>BattleBit Remastered</i> delivers intense vehicular combat that adds new layers of strategy and chaos to every fight.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/671860?t=1730393449","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1730393449","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1730393449","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1730393449","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"BattleBit Remastered features action based, military themed gameplay. As a result, there are displays of combat and war. Gunfire, explosions, death. There is no gore, and visual display of violence is not exaggerated."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reviews</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201d\u2026even in its current state, it\u2019s already one of the more captivating multiplayer shooters on Steam right now.\u201d <strong>IGN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cBattleBit has echoes of what Eric Barone did with Stardew Valley: a small game that punches above its weight and wins people over with unexpected depth and quality.\u201d <strong>PC Gamer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIf you\u2019ve grown tired of extraction shooters and battle royale games and crave something more focused on gunplay, combat, and just having fun over grinding and seasons, I\u2019d recommend\u00a0<i>BattleBit Remastered</i>.\u201d <strong>Kotaku</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into chaotic, large-scale FPS battles with up to 254 players in <i>BattleBit Remastered</i>! Whether you're storming enemy positions with Assault or building critical defences as support, every role counts in this low-poly, adrenaline-pumping battleground. Squad up with open VOIP and level cities with fully destructible environments. Ready to experience the ultimate team-based warfare?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Primary features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible Environments\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/8cff82274c102c808f6befc81329c82d.poster.avif?t=1730393449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/8cff82274c102c808f6befc81329c82d.webm?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/8cff82274c102c808f6befc81329c82d.mp4?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear down walls, collapse buildings, and reshape the battlefield with dynamic 'levolution' mechanics, where every action leaves a lasting impact on the world around you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customizable weapons (WIP)\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/ae6dfbe685917e39f5d2d4468f494a74.poster.avif?t=1730393449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/ae6dfbe685917e39f5d2d4468f494a74.webm?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/ae6dfbe685917e39f5d2d4468f494a74.mp4?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Tailor your arsenal to your playstyle in <i>BattleBit Remastered</i>! Modify everything from scopes to grips or barrels to mags. Create the perfect weapon loadout to dominate every battleground.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >254 Player servers\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/611117d20181595cbd811c9fa4f71487.poster.avif?t=1730393449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/611117d20181595cbd811c9fa4f71487.webm?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/611117d20181595cbd811c9fa4f71487.mp4?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Join the chaos with up to 254 players in epic, large-scale battles! <i>BattleBit Remastered</i> offers massive multiplayer servers where proximity-based voice chat brings every encounter to life! Coordinate strategies or taunt the enemy as you fight for control in the ever-evolving battleground!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicular combat with tanks, helicopters, transports, and sea vehicles.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/2a3d88b00e1fda35b473ad6016327d4d.poster.avif?t=1730393449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/2a3d88b00e1fda35b473ad6016327d4d.webm?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/extras/2a3d88b00e1fda35b473ad6016327d4d.mp4?t=1730393449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Dominate the battlefield with an arsenal of vehicles at your command! From tanks and helicopters to transports and sea vessels, <i>BattleBit Remastered</i> delivers intense vehicular combat that adds new layers of strategy and chaos to every fight.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["SgtOkiDoki","Vilaskis","TheLiquidHorse"],"dlc":[2390150],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/671860/header.jpg?t=1730393449","is_free":fals